  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 81b9501dec89da64eb81f4c230bdd187, type: 3}
  m_Name: Sleeping Potion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HoneyAndHemlock.Customers.CustomerSO
  _requestedPotion: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6c386461d05610c43994937b0937637f, type: 2}
  _request:
  - A family of pixies has moved into the rafters above my bed. They sing at all
    hours. Lovely singing, truly, but I haven't had a night's rest in a fortnight
    and I'm starting to see things.
  - My son just learned how to play the lute and he practices in the room next to
    mine. For hours. The same three notes over and over. I love him dearly but I
    need to sleep!
  _playerResponse:
  - Something for the noise
  - Let's drown that out
  _successfulResponse:
  - I slept from dusk to dawn. Not a single pixie woke me. First time in weeks I
    feel like a person again. You're a blessing, potion maker.
  - I slept through the entire practice session. Didn't hear a single note. I feel
    like a new person. He can practice all he wants now.
  _failedResponse:
  - I'm more awake than ever. And now the pixies are juggling. They weren't juggling
    before. Are they juggling Whistle-Whoppers or am I seeing things?
  - I can hear BETTER now. Every note is crystal clear. I can hear him breathing
    between plucks. What did you give me? This is the opposite of what I needed!
  _cosmicResponse:
  - "I don\u2019t think I\u2019ll ever sleep again after that\u2026 which is exactly
    why I need this potion even more now."
  - Floating in nothing, ancient things reaching down, the whole nightmare. Still
    not worse than the lute. I still need to sleep through the lute.
